# Images are built from the repo root (npm workspaces): send only manifests and sources.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!back/
!front/

# Re-excluded inside the workspaces: installed and built in the image, never copied in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/Dockerfile
# The music repo's history (its files themselves are bundled when present).
**/.git
